1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,600
Every time Flop turns, it can be a tiny bit wrong.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,900
One little mistake is okay.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,800
But after many turns, the mistakes add up, and Flop gets lost!

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,700
The fix: instead of 'turn right 90,' use 'turn to heading.'

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,900
That means 'face that direction,' like 'face the window.'

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:24,400
Flop checks its compass every time, so mistakes don't pile up.

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,100
Smart robot!

